---

<section class="emergency-intro">

    <div class="container intro-grid">

        <div class="intro-content">

            <span class="overline">
                EMERGENCY HEATING
            </span>

            <h2>
                What Counts as an Emergency,
                <span>and What Can Wait Until Morning</span>
            </h2>

            <p>
                Not every heating failure is an emergency, and treating every
                call the same usually costs homeowners money they never needed
                to spend.
            </p>

            <p>
                If the house is getting colder, there are elderly people,
                young children, someone unwell, or there is a risk of frozen
                pipes, call immediately. Otherwise, we will honestly tell you
                if the repair can safely wait until the next working day.
            </p>

            <div class="priority-box">

                <h3>Call Immediately If:</h3>

                <ul>

                    <li>
                        House temperature keeps dropping
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        Elderly people or young children are home
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        Pipes could freeze overnight
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        Your heating system has completely stopped
                    </li>

                </ul>

            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="intro-image">

            <img
                src="/images/svc-emergency-detail.webp"
                alt="Cold home waiting for emergency heating repair"
            >

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<style>

.emergency-intro{

padding:110px 24px;

background:#fff;

}

.container{

width:min(1200px,100%);

margin:auto;

}

.intro-grid{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:1fr 520px;

gap:60px;

align-items:center;

}

.overline{

display:inline-block;

margin-bottom:18px;

color:#ea580c;

font-size:.8rem;

font-weight:800;

letter-spacing:2px;

}

.overline::after{

content:"";

display:block;

width:64px;

height:3px;

background:#f97316;

margin-top:10px;

border-radius:999px;

}

.intro-content h2{

font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4vw,3.5rem);

line-height:1.1;

margin:0 0 24px;

color:#0f172a;

letter-spacing:-1px;

}

.intro-content h2 span{

display:block;

}

.intro-content p{

font-size:1.08rem;

line-height:1.9;

color:#64748b;

margin-bottom:22px;

}

.priority-box{

margin-top:34px;

padding:28px;

border-radius:18px;

border:2px solid #fde68a;

background:#fffbeb;

transition:.35s;

}

.priority-box:hover{

transform:translateY(-6px);

border-color:#f97316;

box-shadow:

0 0 24px rgba(249,115,22,.15),

0 20px 45px rgba(15,23,42,.10);

}

.priority-box h3{

margin:0 0 18px;

color:#0f172a;

font-size:1.25rem;

}

.priority-box ul{

margin:0;

padding:0;

list-style:none;

display:grid;

gap:14px;

}

.priority-box li{

position:relative;

padding-left:34px;

color:#334155;

line-height:1.6;

font-weight:600;

}

.priority-box li::before{

content:"✓";

position:absolute;

left:0;

top:0;

width:22px;

height:22px;

display:grid;

place-items:center;

border-radius:50%;

background:#f97316;

color:#fff;

font-size:.8rem;

font-weight:800;

box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(249,115,22,.35);

animation:pulseCheck 2.8s infinite;

}

.intro-image{

overflow:hidden;

border-radius:24px;

box-shadow:

0 24px 60px rgba(15,23,42,.16);

}

.intro-image img{

width:100%;

display:block;

height:640px;

object-fit:cover;

transition:.6s;

}

.intro-image:hover img{

transform:scale(1.05);

}

@keyframes pulseCheck{

0%,100%{

transform:scale(1);

}

50%{

transform:scale(1.12);

}

}

@media(max-width:991px){

.intro-grid{

grid-template-columns:1fr;

}

.intro-image img{

height:420px;

}

}

</style>